Workspace selection recognises the current Probierz checkout by its release identity

Probierz Desktop accepted a workspace only when probierz/package.json and
probierz/agent/history.mjs were present, files the Rust Probierz no longer
has, so every current checkout was refused and discovery found none.
A workspace is now a parent holding probierz/.wisent-release.json whose
product is probierz and probierz/probierz-rs/Cargo.toml, each a regular file
and not a symlink. workspaceProblem names which file is missing, unreadable
or names another product, and isWorkspace reads it. The README and the
interfaces page state the new requirement and how the retained journey is
run against a real checkout, which accepts the parent and refuses the
repository directory itself.

